<title>LATVIA: Most yields fall at Latvian T-bill auction.</title>
<headline>Most yields fall at Latvian T-bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most yields fell on Latvian T-bills at Wednesday's auction with only the yield on the 28-day paper rising, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>All figures in millions of lats unless otherwise stated.</p>
<p> Maturity	 Issue    Demand     Yield (PCT) Previous yield</p>
<p> 28 days	  0.75     0.96	 9.88	  9.84</p>
<p> 91 days	  1.0	1.61	 10.21	 10.27</p>
<p> six-month	2.0	4.94	 11.54	 11.72</p>
<p> one-year	 1.0	3.13	 12.86	 12.97</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom +3717-22 66 93</p>
</text>
